<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of April 25, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>					    April 25   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,713  1,568   6,508</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				129    127	96</p>
<p>CCC					    2,028  2,077   1,306</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,870  3,772   7,910</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,492  1,848    unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				215    211    unq</p>
<p>CCC					    2,308  2,308    unq</p>
<p>TOTAL					  4,015  4,367    unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
